{"id":"especta_culo","lemma":"espectáculo","pos":"noun","rank":1084,"glosses":["show, performance (play, dance, some act or series of acts of public entertainment, often live)","spectacle, show"],"ipa":"/espeɡˈtakulo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"espectáculos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/64/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-espect%C3%A1culo.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Te gustó el espectáculo?","en":"Did you enjoy the show?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/459261"},{"text":"El espectáculo fue interesante.","en":"The show was interesting.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/516357"},{"text":"¿Cuándo empieza el espectáculo?","en":"When does the show start?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/103618"},{"text":"El espectáculo es el lunes.","en":"The show is on Monday.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/352351"},{"text":"¿Cuándo es tu próximo espectáculo?","en":"When is your next show?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461768"}]}